---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="TripCanvas privacy policy.">
  <div class="page-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="container" style="max-width:720px; padding-bottom:4rem;">
    <p>Your privacy is important to us. This policy outlines how TripCanvas collects, uses, and protects your information.</p>
    <h3>Information We Collect</h3>
    <p>We may collect basic analytics data (page views, browser type) and information you provide via contact forms.</p>
    <h3>Cookies</h3>
    <p>We use cookies to improve your browsing experience and for analytics. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
    <h3>Third-Party Services</h3>
    <p>We use Google Analytics and social media plugins. These services may collect data according to their own policies.</p>
    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>For privacy-related questions, email us at <a href="mailto:hello@tripcanvas.co">hello@tripcanvas.co</a>.</p>
    <p>Last updated: April 2026.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
